  "accepted_limits": [
    "This closes the six real XLS/ODS/ET non-XLSX two-hop routes for one deterministic rich workbook; it is not a final GOLDEN-010 pass.",
    "The projection proves values, formulas and cached values, merged cells, selected styles and widths, hidden-sheet state, chart and shape counts, one image, one hyperlink, one comment, one list validation, and auto-filter state. It does not prove chart series/title internals, pivots, macros, external links, protection, signatures, or every spreadsheet feature.",
    "VIS-024 ran before a discoverable LibreOffice toolchain existed. VIS-105 supersedes that environment statement with a focused official LibreOffice-only XLS->ODS and ODS->XLS two-hop addendum; system-wide installation and broader fidelity remain unclaimed.",
    "Old Tk and old PySide6 timestamped output names are not required in current; current stable source-owned names are an architecture and UX improvement.",
    "The old PySide6 direct probe explicitly configured keep_intermediates=false because the unbootstrapped workspace helper defaults true; this matches the product default and avoids treating a harness-only auxiliary XLSX as a final artifact.",
    "Two harness incidents were corrected before acceptance: GB18030 old-log decoding and a cleanup race where an Excel process exited between snapshot and termination. Neither incident was a production conversion failure."
  ]
